th gray white  fibrous breast parenchyma that is slightly firmer and with a gritty consistency in the region below the skin scar  The nipple and areola are unremarkable  The axillary adipose tissue is sectioned  revealing several tan pink  soft  grossly unremarkable lymph nodes measuring up to 1cm in greatest diameter  SECTION CODE  A B   breast and deep resection margin in the area underlying the scar C through G   breast parenchyma in the area underlying the scar H I   random sections from unremarkable breast J   nipple K   skin scar L M   axillary lymph nodes  Labeled  Right additional axillary tissue  is a 1 x 1 x 0 3cm piece of adipose tissue  Sectioning reveals a lymph node most of which has been replaced by fat  The specimen is bisected and submitted entirely in N  Resident  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  AMB GEN SURGICAL   ACC 4 REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST WITH AXILLA PART B  RIGHT ADDITIONAL AXILLARY TISSUE   report_end  , Unchecked.
