 1 5cm lateral to the biopsy site  A second REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm tan pink fibrous area is also noted 5 0cm lateral to the biopsy site  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  The axillary tail is dissected to reveal multiple unremarkable tan lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 1 5cm in diameter  Section Code  A B  representative sections of mass with closest deep resection margin  C H  representative sections of mass  I  representative section of fibrous area  1 5cm lateral to biospy site  J  representative section of fibrous area  6cm lateral to biopsy site  K L  representative sections of unremarkable breast cassettes  M Q  axillary lymph nodes  Resident  Simon Bergman  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  COMP  BREAST HEALTH CENTER REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  Martha Elizabeth Meaney  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST AND AXILLARY CONTENTS   report_end  , Unchecked.
