TOMY    GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received are 6 containers  which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN     A  Received fresh  labeled  right breast  stitch at 12 o clock   is a REMOVED_DATE x  21 5 x 4 3cm mastectomy specimen with a stitch designating 12 o clock  The  nipple and areola appear unremarkable  The anterior margin is inked blue and  the posterior margin is inked black  The specimen consists of lobular  soft  yellow adipose tissue with a moderate amount of white  fibrous tissue  No focal  lesions or masses are noted  and no biopsy clip is seen in the area of the lower  outer quadrant  Lymph nodes are not detected in the lateral tissue  The  following representative sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower outer quadrant with posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper outer quadrant with anterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper inner quadrant with anterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower inner quadrant    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Central region     B  Received fresh  labeled  left breast  long stitch lateral  short stitch  superior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm mastectomy specimen with a short suture  designating the superior aspect and a long suture designating the lateral  aspect  The nipple and areola appear unremarkable  The anterior margin is inked  blue and the posterior margin is inked black  The specimen contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  x 0 4cm hemorrhagic cystic region with a clip in the inner middle portion of  the breast  0 3cm from the anterior margin and 2 9cm from the posterior  margin  The surrounding parenchyma is comprised of unremarkable white  fibrous  tissue with interspersed yellow adipose tissue  The specimen also contains an  ill defined REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fibrous  white pink  partially cystic region 10  cm more medial to the previously mentioned clip in the superior midportion of  the breast at 12 o clock  This ill defined fibrous region is 1 8cm from the  anterior margin and 2 1cm from the posterior margin  A slightly firm   triangular white fibrous region is noted 2cm deeper to the ill defined fibrous  region along the anterior magin  0 3cm from the anterior margin and 5cm from  the deep margin  No clip is identified in either fibrous region  The region of  the anterior lower outer quadrant  an area with a previous biopsy and clip per  the clinical records  reveals white fibrous tissue with no mass or clip  identified  Lymph nodes are not detected in the lateral tissue     Additionally received in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm aggregate of  irregular yellow white fibroadipose tissue  which is serially sectioned to  reveal unremarkable yellow pink fatty cut surfaces  The following  representative sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Hemorrhagic region in the inner middle breast with the region of the  clip and anterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue intervening between the hemorrhagic cavity and the center portion of  the breast    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Ill defined fibrous region at 12 o clock  nearest anterior margin in   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Posterior margin adjacent to ill defined fibrous region    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue intervening between ill defined fibrous region and anterior lower  outer quadrant    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior lower outer quadrant tissue    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Central tissue    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Slightly firm fibrous region  entirely submitted  closest anterior  margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue intervening between well and ill defined white fibrous regions    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remainder of ill defined fibrous region    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional tissue from lower outer quadrant     C  Received fresh