ve sections of firm  tan gray  gritty tissue in relation to deep margin  H  firm  tan  gritty tissue in relation to both deep and superior anterior margin   superior anterior with red dot of ink   I  firm tissue in relation to deep margin  J  representative section of breast parenchyma from lateral margin  K  representative section of breast parenchyma with ink on medial margin  L  representative section of firm  breast mass abutting superior anterior margin  M  representative section of skin ellipse with underlying breast parenchyma  N  nipple and areola  with underlying parenchyma  representative section  Located within the axillary fat are numerous semifirm to firm lymph nodes  measuring from REMOVED_DATE to 1 2cm in diameter  Lymph nodes are submitted in O through U  Resident  Douglas B  Flieder  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT  BIOPSY    FOCAL DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Diagnosis by  Max L  Goodman  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kenneth Kenji Tanabe  M D  Douglas Brian Flieder  M D  PART   BREAST   AXILLARY NODES  LEFT  , Unchecked.
