ith this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  14 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 16 09     SPECIAL STAINS Addendum     NOTE  Because of impression of endocrine differentiation  an argyrophil stain is performed  but it is negative  Added by  John H  Eichhorn  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 19 21 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm oriented fragment of fibroadipose tissue  with two long stitches indicating the lateral margin  a short and a long stitch indicating the anterior margin  and two short stitches indicating the superior margin  The posterior aspect of the specimen is inked black  the anterior aspect is inked blue  and the superior aspect is inked orange  The specimen is sectioned lateral to medial to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm ill defined  firm  tan white area with a central area of hemorrhage present 0 3cm from the deep  posterior  black  margin  0 7cm from the lateral margin  0 4cm from the anterior  blue  margin  and 0 8cm from the superior  orange  margin  The specimen is submitted entirely  lateral to medial  in A F  Gross Description by  RHONDA YANTISS  MD Resident  MELINDA J  FAN  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS   LEFT BREAST   SMALL WELL DEFINED LESION  TOO SMALL TO FREEZE  O R  Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD O R  Diagnosis by  ESTHER OLIVA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
